In May 2021, [[José Antonio Kast]] dismissed the idea of holding a presidential primary with Chile Vamos.<ref>{{cite web|last=Vallejos|first=Leonardo|date=23 May 2021|title=Chile Vamos se debate entre seguir o no en pacto con el Partido Republicano de cara a las próximas elecciones|url=https://www.emol.com/noticias/Nacional/2021/05/23/1021651/Chile-Vamos-Republicano-pacto.html|access-date=11 August 2021|website=Emol|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220203518/https://www.emol.com/noticias/Nacional/2021/05/23/1021651/Chile-Vamos-Republicano-pacto.html|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last=Soto|first=Ximena|date=18 July 2021|title=J.A. Kast o la otra incógnita pendiente de la derecha: su partido dice que llega a noviembre "sí o sí"|url=https://www.latercera.com/la-tercera-pm/noticia/ja-kast-o-la-otra-incognita-pendiente-de-la-derecha-su-partido-dice-que-llega-a-noviembre-si-o-si/5PYMFLC6ZVFARH4VZJ2FHXSEBU/|access-date=11 August 2021|website=La Tercera|archive-date=11 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210811041555/https://www.latercera.com/la-tercera-pm/noticia/ja-kast-o-la-otra-incognita-pendiente-de-la-derecha-su-partido-dice-que-llega-a-noviembre-si-o-si/5PYMFLC6ZVFARH4VZJ2FHXSEBU/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last=Valenzuela|first=Paula|date=2 August 2021|title=Chile Vamos y el Partido Republicano mueven sus fichas para la batalla del emblemático distrito 11|url=https://www.t13.cl/noticia/politica/chile-vamos-y-partido-republicano-mueven-sus-fichas-batalla-del-emblematico-distrito-11|access-date=11 August 2021|website=T13|archive-date=11 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210811041556/https://www.t13.cl/noticia/politica/chile-vamos-y-partido-republicano-mueven-sus-fichas-batalla-del-emblematico-distrito-11|url-status=live}}</ref> On August 6, 2021, the [[Christian Conservative Party (Chile)|Christian Conservative Party]], along with the Republican Party and other independents, registered the Christian Social Front pact with the Electoral Service for the parliamentary elections in November.<ref>{{cite web|last=Claro|first=Hernán|date=6 August 2021|title=Partido Republicano inscribe pacto parlamentario Frente Social Cristiano|url=https://www.eldinamo.cl/entretencion/2023/01/31/amparo-noguera-aseguro-que-van-a-llorar-con-el-final-de-la-ley-de-baltazar/|access-date=7 August 2021|website=El Dínamo|archive-date=6 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210806220022/https://www.eldinamo.cl/politica/2021/08/06/partido-republicano-inscribe-pacto-parlamentario-frente-social-cristiano/amp/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="mostrador">{{cite web|date=6 August 2021|title=Frente Social Cristiano, el nuevo pacto parlamentario conformado por el partido de José Antonio Kast para competir en elecciones|url=https://www.elmostrador.cl/elecciones-2021/2021/08/06/frente-social-cristiano-el-nuevo-pacto-parlamentario-conformado-por-el-partido-de-jose-antonio-kast-para-competir-en-elecciones/|access-date=7 August 2021|website=El Mostrador|archive-date=7 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210807031242/https://www.elmostrador.cl/elecciones-2021/2021/08/06/frente-social-cristiano-el-nuevo-pacto-parlamentario-conformado-por-el-partido-de-jose-antonio-kast-para-competir-en-elecciones/|url-status=live}}</ref> Kast officially registered his candidacy before the Electoral Service on 19 August 2021.<ref>{{cite web|title=José Antonio Kast: "Estoy preparándome para una primera vuelta presidencial"|url=https://www.cnnchile.com/lodijeronencnn/jose-antonio-kast-se-prepara-primera-vuelta-presidencial_20210119/|date=19 January 2021|access-date=14 February 2021|website=CNN Chile|language=es|archive-date=26 January 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210126081938/https://www.cnnchile.com/lodijeronencnn/jose-antonio-kast-se-prepara-primera-vuelta-presidencial_20210119/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|title=Culmina declaración de candidaturas para las Elecciones Generales de noviembre|url=https://www.servel.cl/culmina-declaracion-de-candidaturas-para-las-elecciones-generales-de-noviembre/|date=23 August 2021|access-date=14 August 2021|work=Servicio Electoral de Chile|language=es-CL|archive-date=24 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210824045045/https://www.servel.cl/culmina-declaracion-de-candidaturas-para-las-elecciones-generales-de-noviembre/|url-status=live}}</ref>

