</gallery>
*'''[[Eduardo Artés]]''' ([[Patriotic Union (Chile)|UP]]): The current president of the UP was confirmed by his party as its presidential candidate in June 2021.<ref>{{cite web|last=Estay Elgueta|first=Mario|url=https://www.infogate.cl/2021/06/20/union-patriotica-ratifica-a-eduardo-artes-como-candidato-presidencial-y-propone-ff-aa-integradas-a-la-produccion/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210620125611/https://www.infogate.cl/2021/06/20/union-patriotica-ratifica-a-eduardo-artes-como-candidato-presidencial-y-propone-ff-aa-integradas-a-la-produccion/|title=Unión Patriótica ratifica a Eduardo Artés como candidato presidencial y propone FF.AA. "integradas a la producción"|website=Infogate|date=20 June 2021|archive-date=20 June 2021|language=es-CL}}</ref>
*'''[[Marco Enríquez-Ominami]]''' ([[Progressive Party (Chile)|PRO]]): In February 2021, his party asked the three-time presidential candidate to be once again their contender for the November 2021 election.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.progresistas.cl/partido-progresista-pide-a-marco-enriquez-ominami-que-sea-el-candidato-de-la-coalicion-para-las-primarias-presidenciales-de-los-partidos-de-izquierda/|title=Partido Progresista pide a Marco Enríquez-Ominami que sea el candidato de la coalición para las primarias presidenciales de los partidos de izquierda|publisher=[[Progressive Party (Chile)|Partido Progresista de Chile]]|date=2 February 2021|access-date=20 July 2021|language=es-CL|archive-date=20 July 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210720050118/https://www.progresistas.cl/partido-progresista-pide-a-marco-enriquez-ominami-que-sea-el-candidato-de-la-coalicion-para-las-primarias-presidenciales-de-los-partidos-de-izquierda/|url-status=live}}</ref> On 23 July PRO's president, Camilo Lagos, said they would either participate in a primary or present a candidate directly to the November election. If their preferred choice, Enríquez-Ominami, was unable to run due legal restrictions, he stated that they would support senator [[Alejandro Guillier]] as their candidate.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.elmostrador.cl/elecciones-2021/2021/07/23/pro-quiere-estar-en-la-papeleta-presidencial-de-noviembre-y-baraja-dos-nombres-me-o-y-el-senador-alejandro-guillier/|title=PRO quiere estar en la papeleta presidencial de noviembre y baraja dos nombres: ME-O y el senador Alejandro Guillier|website=[[El Mostrador]]|date=23 July 2021|access-date=27 July 2021|language=es-CL|archive-date=27 July 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210727054227/https://www.elmostrador.cl/elecciones-2021/2021/07/23/pro-quiere-estar-en-la-papeleta-presidencial-de-noviembre-y-baraja-dos-nombres-me-o-y-el-senador-alejandro-guillier/|url-status=live}}</ref> On 26 July 2021 the PRO declared they would not participate in the Constituent Unity primary to take place on 21 August 2021.<ref>{{cite web|last=Dote|first=Sebastián|url=https://www.eldinamo.cl/politica/2021/07/26/pro-no-participara-de-la-consulta-ciudadana-de-unidad-constituyente/|title=PRO no participará de la consulta ciudadana de Unidad Constituyente|website=El Dínamo|date=26 July 2021|access-date=27 July 2021|language=es-CL|archive-date=26 July 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210726233615/https://www.eldinamo.cl/politica/2021/07/26/pro-no-participara-de-la-consulta-ciudadana-de-unidad-constituyente/|url-status=live}}</ref> On 4 September 2021 a regional electoral tribunal (TER) ordered his name to be removed from the electoral roll, thus disqualifying him from seeking office.<ref>{{Cite news|title=Marco Enríquez-Ominami queda fuera de la presidencial por caso OAS: líder del PRO lo calificó de "injusto y arbitrario" y anunció apelación|url=https://www.elmostrador.cl/elecciones-2021/2021/09/04/marco-enriquez-ominami-quedo-fuera-de-la-presidencial-por-caso-oas-su-defensa-apelara-ante-el-tricel/|date=2021-09-04|access-date=2021-09-05|work=El Mostrador|language=es-CL|archive-date=5 September 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210905084450/https://www.elmostrador.cl/elecciones-2021/2021/09/04/marco-enriquez-ominami-quedo-fuera-de-la-presidencial-por-caso-oas-su-defensa-apelara-ante-el-tricel/|url-status=live}}</ref> However, he appealed successfully to the Election Certification Board (Tricel).<ref>{{Cite news|title=Cuarta aventura por La Moneda: Tricel confirma que Marco Enríquez-Ominami podrá estar en la papeleta presidencial de noviembre|url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/cuarta-aventura-por-la-moneda-tricel-confirma-que-marco-enriquez-ominami-podra-estar-en-la-papeleta-presidencial-de-noviembre/PG547MBJERER7OQ43DZ6UQVNKY/|date=2021-09-10|access-date=2021-09-11|work=La Tercera|language=es-CL|archive-date=11 September 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210911070628/https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/cuarta-aventura-por-la-moneda-tricel-confirma-que-marco-enriquez-ominami-podra-estar-en-la-papeleta-presidencial-de-noviembre/PG547MBJERER7OQ43DZ6UQVNKY/|url-status=live}}</ref>
*'''[[Franco Parisi]]''' ([[Party of the People (Chile)|PDG]]): Parisi is an economist who ran for president in 2013, gaining 10% of the vote. He registered his candidacy for president on 23 August 2021.<ref>{{Cite news|title=Partido de la Gente inscribió candidatura presidencial de Franco Parisi|url=https://www.t13.cl/noticia/elecciones-2021/politica/franco-parisi-inscribe-su-candidatura-presidencial-servel|date=23 August 2021|access-date=24 August 2021|work=T13|language=es-CL|archive-date=24 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210824003148/https://www.t13.cl/noticia/elecciones-2021/politica/franco-parisi-inscribe-su-candidatura-presidencial-servel|url-status=live}}</ref>

===Rejected ===
*'''[[Diego Ancalao]]''' (independent): Ancalao is a [[Mapuche]] activist. He was proclaimed on 20 August 2021 by the [[The List of the People|List of the People]], a leftist movement, after he garnered more endorsements from independent electors at the Electoral Service's online platform than the other two candidates in competition, Soledad Mella and Ingrid Conejeros, between 12 and 19 August 2021.<ref>{{Cite news|title=Quién es Diego Ancalao, el presidenciable de la Lista del Pueblo que juntó las firmas exigidas por el Servel horas antes de que expirara el plazo|url=https://www.ex-ante.cl/quien-es-diego-ancalao-el-candidato-presidencial-de-la-lista-del-pueblo-que-aun-no-reune-las-firmas-ante-el-servel/|date=20 August 2021|access-date=24 August 2021|work=[[Ex-Ante (online newspaper)|Ex-Ante]]|language=es-CL|archive-date=24 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210824022314/https://www.ex-ante.cl/quien-es-diego-ancalao-el-candidato-presidencial-de-la-lista-del-pueblo-que-aun-no-reune-las-firmas-ante-el-servel/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|title=Lista del Pueblo proclama a Diego Ancalao como candidato presidencial: Aún no tiene todas las firmas|url=https://www.emol.com/noticias/Nacional/2021/08/20/1030240/lista-del-pueblo-ancalao-presidencial.html|last=Aton|date=20 August 2021|access-date=24 August 2021|work=Emol|editor-last=Marín|editor-first=V.|language=es-CL|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220201550/https://www.emol.com/noticias/Nacional/2021/08/20/1030240/lista-del-pueblo-ancalao-presidencial.html|url-status=live}}</ref> The Electoral Service, though, rejected his candidacy on 26 August 2021 on the grounds he did not provide the required minimum number of endorsements from independent electors.<ref name="LT 2021-08-26">{{Cite news|title=Dos candidatos menos: Servel denuncia ante Fiscalía firmas falsificadas en candidatura de Diego Ancalao y también rechaza postulación de Gino Lorenzini|url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/servel-rechaza-candidaturas-de-gino-lorenzini-ind-y-diego-ancalao-ldp-y-los-deja-fuera-de-la-carrera-presidencial/BA27E44KDZFQLKLGJVHMB4SOJI/|last1=Reyes P.|first1=Carlos|date=2021-08-26|access-date=2021-08-27|work=La Tercera|last2=Garrido|first2=Mónica|language=es-CL|archive-date=27 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210827051434/https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/servel-rechaza-candidaturas-de-gino-lorenzini-ind-y-diego-ancalao-ldp-y-los-deja-fuera-de-la-carrera-presidencial/BA27E44KDZFQLKLGJVHMB4SOJI/|url-status=live}}</ref>
*'''[[Gino Lorenzini]]''' (independent): Lorenzini is an economist and entrepreneur. He registered his candidacy for president on 23 August 2021, presenting over 42 thousand endorsements from independent electors, more than the minimum required by law.<ref>{{Cite news|title=Gino Lorenzini inscribe candidatura presidencial: "Haremos un capitalismo popular"|url=https://www.24horas.cl/elecciones-2021/gino-lorenzini-inscribe-candidatura-presidencial-haremos-un-capitalismo-popular-4935326|author=24Horas.cl Tvn|date=23 August 2021|access-date=24 August 2021|work=24 Horas|language=es-CL|archive-date=24 August 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210824004118/https://www.24horas.cl/elecciones-2021/gino-lorenzini-inscribe-candidatura-presidencial-haremos-un-capitalismo-popular-4935326|url-status=live}}</ref> However, the Electoral Service rejected his candidacy on 26 August 2021 because the law requires independent candidates to hold their status as independent for up to a year before the election, and he was part of the [[Party of the People (Chile)|Party of the People]] during some of that time.<ref name="LT 2021-08-26" />

===Declined to be candidates===
*'''[[Pamela Jiles (journalist)|Pamela Jiles]]''' ([[Humanist Party (Chile)|PH]]): Jiles is a journalist,<ref>{{cite web|date=2 March 2003|title=Yo, Pamela|url=http://www.lanacion.cl/p4_lanacion/site/artic/20030301/pags/20030301210133.html|url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120324100124/http://www.lanacion.cl/p4_lanacion/site/artic/20030301/pags/20030301210133.html|archive-date=24 March 2012|access-date=10 December 2020|website=La Nación|language=es-CL}}</ref> television personality and [[Left-wing politics|leftist]] politician. She pursues her political career as deputy for District 12 in the [[Santiago Metropolitan Region]]. She comes from a family of communists and has praised [[Fidel Castro]].<ref>{{cite web|last=Cortez|first=Manuel (PiensaChile)|date=24 February 2009|title=La candidatura va en serio: Pamela Jiles Presidenta|url=http://www.elclarin.cl/index.php?option=com_content&task=view&id=15256&Itemid=2729|url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120313184030/http://www.elclarin.cl/index.php?option=com_content&task=view&id=15256&Itemid=2729|archive-date=13 March 2012|access-date=10 December 2020|website=El Clarín|language=es-CL}}</ref> She appeared as a potential presidential candidate with the most support in just one opinion poll.<ref name="activa"/> After her partner lost the Santiago governor race in May 2021, she withdrew her name from consideration.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.theclinic.cl/2021/05/17/pamela-jiles-y-su-candidatura-presidencial-tras-fracaso-de-pablo-maltes-nunca-he-sido-proclamada/|title=Pamela Jiles y su candidatura presidencial tras fracaso de Pablo Maltés: "Nunca he sido proclamada"|date=17 May 2021|access-date=14 July 2021|website=The Clinic|language=es-CL|archive-date=28 June 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210628192729/https://www.theclinic.cl/2021/05/17/pamela-jiles-y-su-candidatura-presidencial-tras-fracaso-de-pablo-maltes-nunca-he-sido-proclamada/|url-status=live}}</ref>
*'''[[Izkia Siches]]''' (independent): Siches is a physician who has served as president of the [[Chilean Medical College]] since 2017.<ref name="Time 100 next Izkia Siches">{{cite news|title=2021 TIME100 Next: Izkia Siches Pastén|magazine=Time|url=https://time.com/collection/time100-next-2021/5937736/izkia-siches-pasten/|access-date=3 May 2021|archive-date=14 May 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210514223306/https://time.com/collection/time100-next-2021/5937736/izkia-siches-pasten/|url-status=live}}</ref> A self-described [[feminist]]<ref>{{cite web|date=19 October 2018|title=Izkia Siches Pastén: "Quisiera seducir a todos con el feminismo"|url=https://www.latercera.com/paula/izquia-siches-pasten-quisiera-seducir-todos-feminismo/|website=[[La Tercera]]|accessdate=8 January 2021|language=es-CL|archive-date=3 May 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210503052745/https://www.latercera.com/paula/izquia-siches-pasten-quisiera-seducir-todos-feminismo/|url-status=live}}</ref> and past member of the [[Communist Youth of Chile|Communist Youth]],<ref>{{cite web|author=pauta|date=18 March 2020|title=La figura positiva en medio de la crisis: Izkia Siches|url=https://www.pauta.cl/nacional/izkia-siches-como-crecio-su-en-la-crisis-del-covid-19|website=pauta|url-status=live|language=es|access-date=5 July 2021|archive-date=18 May 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210518121504/https://www.pauta.cl/nacional/izkia-siches-como-crecio-su-en-la-crisis-del-covid-19}}</ref> Siches became nationally known during the [[COVID-19 pandemic in Chile|COVID-19 pandemic]] for her criticisms of the government's handling of public health measures.<ref>{{cite web|date=13 June 2020|title=Críticas a Izkia Siches y en contra de la cuarentena total: La postura de Enrique Paris durante la crisis sanitaria|url=https://www.cnnchile.com/pais/enrique-paris-crisis-sanitaria-coronavirus_20200613/|website=[[CNN Chile]]|language=es|accessdate=22 December 2020|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200903111803/https://www.cnnchile.com/pais/enrique-paris-crisis-sanitaria-coronavirus_20200613/|archivedate=3 September 2020}}</ref> Her high approval ratings during the pandemic<ref>{{cite news|title=Encuesta CEP: Aprobación del presidente alcanza el 9% y Pamela Jiles es el personaje político mejor evaluado|language=es|work=www.duna.cl|url=https://www.duna.cl/noticias/2021/04/29/encuesta-cep-aprobacion-del-presidente-alcanza-el-9-y-pamela-jiles-es-el-personaje-politico-mejor-evaluado/|access-date=3 May 2021|archive-date=3 May 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210503074306/https://www.duna.cl/noticias/2021/04/29/encuesta-cep-aprobacion-del-presidente-alcanza-el-9-y-pamela-jiles-es-el-personaje-politico-mejor-evaluado/|url-status=live}}</ref> led to speculation she would run for president, but she ultimately declined.<ref>{{cite web|date=6 September 2020|title=Izkia Siches por candidatura presidencial: "Me falta experiencia, así que lo descarto"|url=https://www.cnnchile.com/lodijeronencnn/izkia-siches-descarta-candidatura-presidencial_20200906/|website=[[CNN Chile]]|language=es|accessdate=22 December 2020|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20200907052111/https://www.cnnchile.com/lodijeronencnn/izkia-siches-descarta-candidatura-presidencial_20200906/|archivedate=7 September 2020}}</ref><ref name="Time 100 next Izkia Siches"/>
*'''[[René Rubeska]]''' ([[National Citizen Party (Chile)|PNC]]): In June 2021, the [[National Citizen Party (Chile)|National Citizen Party]] had announced its intention to bring its president René Rubeska as presidential candidate.<ref>{{cite web|date=13 June 2021|title=Consejo general del partido nacional ciudadano proclama a rene rubezka balboa como candidato presidencial|url=https://partidonacionalciudadano.cl/consejo-general-del-partido-nacional-ciudadano-proclama-a-rene-rubezka-balboa-como-candidato-presidencial/|url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220104210918/https://partidonacionalciudadano.cl/consejo-general-del-partido-nacional-ciudadano-proclama-a-rene-rubezka-balboa-como-candidato-presidencial/|archive-date=4 January 2022|access-date=4 January 2022|language=es-CL}}</ref> However, the party was unable to gather the necessary signatures to register his candidacy.

