==Endorsements==
After the first round, candidates [[Sebastián Sichel|Sichel]] and [[Franco Parisi|Parisi]] endorsed Kast.<ref name=SP>{{cite web|last=Carrasco|first=Rodolfo|title=Sichel se compromete a apoyar a Kast en segunda vuelta luego de que se aprobaran sus nueve condiciones|url=http://www.df.cl/noticias/economia-y-politica/politica/sichel-se-compromete-a-apoyar-a-kast-en-segunda-vuelta-luego-de-que-se/2021-12-02/154910.html|access-date=2021-12-19|website=Diario Financiero|language=Spanish|archive-date=19 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211219175643/https://www.df.cl/noticias/economia-y-politica/politica/sichel-se-compromete-a-apoyar-a-kast-en-segunda-vuelta-luego-de-que-se/2021-12-02/154910.html|url-status=live}}</ref>

Boric was endorsed by [[Marco Enríquez-Ominami|Enríquez-Ominami]] and [[Yasna Provoste|Provoste]].<ref name=EOP>{{cite web|date=2021-11-23|title=Provoste Announces Support for Boric for the Ballot: "We will not delay like the FA did in 2017" {{!}} National|url=https://today.in-24.com/News/632697.html|access-date=2021-12-19|website=Today 24 English|language=en-us|archive-date=19 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211219175643/https://today.in-24.com/News/632697.html|url-status=live}}</ref> Former President [[Michelle Bachelet]] returned to Chile from her role as UN Human Rights High Commissioner to formally endorse Boric.<ref name=Bach>{{cite web|title=Former Chilean President Bachelet announces she will vote for Boric|url=https://en.mercopress.com/2021/12/15/former-chilean-president-bachelet-announces-she-will-vote-for-boric|access-date=2021-12-19|website=MercoPress|language=en|archive-date=19 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211219175634/https://en.mercopress.com/2021/12/15/former-chilean-president-bachelet-announces-she-will-vote-for-boric|url-status=live}}</ref>

On 9 December, parliamentarians and public figures from over 15 countries signed a statement endorsing Boric.<ref name=Solidarity>{{cite web|url=https://progressive.international/wire/2021-12-08-international-solidarity-once-failed-the-people-of-chile-it-must-not-fail-today/en|title="International solidarity once failed the people of Chile. It must not fail today."|website=[[Progressive International]]|date=December 9, 2021|accessdate=December 20, 2021|archive-date=19 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211219122700/https://progressive.international/wire/2021-12-08-international-solidarity-once-failed-the-people-of-chile-it-must-not-fail-today/en/|url-status=live}}</ref>

