== Aftermath ==
{{multiple image
 | align = right
 | direction = vertical
 | width = 250
 | image1 = Gabriel Boric at victory speech , santiago, chile.jpg
 | image2 = Gabriel Boric Front portrait.jpg
 | caption2 = Gabriel Boric's victory celebration in the [[Alameda (Santiago)|Alameda]].
}}
On 19 December 2021, shortly after the preliminary results of the second round were publicized, Kast conceded defeat and congratulated Boric through a [[Tweet (Twitter)|tweet]] saying "I have just talked to Gabriel Boric and have congratulated him for his big triumph. From now on he is the president-elect of Chile and deserves all of our respect and constructive collaboration. Chile is always first".<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.semana.com/mundo/articulo/atencion-jose-antonio-kast-felicita-a-boric-por-su-gran-triunfo-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/202116/ |title=ATENCIÓN: José Antonio Kast felicita a Boric 'por su gran triunfo' en las elecciones de Chile |publisher=Semana.com |date= 20 December 2021|accessdate=2021-12-20 |archive-date=20 December 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220073433/https://www.semana.com/mundo/articulo/atencion-jose-antonio-kast-felicita-a-boric-por-su-gran-triunfo-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/202116/ |url-status=live }}</ref> Later that day, Kast visited Boric at the latter's campaign headquarters in central Santiago.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/region-metropolitana/2021/12/19/kast-llego-hasta-el-comando-de-boric-minutos-antes-de-su-discurso-en-la-alameda.shtml|title=Kast llegó hasta el comando de Boric minutos antes de su discurso en La Alameda|accessdate=2021-12-20|date=2021-12-19|work=Radio Bío-Bío|language=es|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220012221/https://www.biobiochile.cl/noticias/nacional/region-metropolitana/2021/12/19/kast-llego-hasta-el-comando-de-boric-minutos-antes-de-su-discurso-en-la-alameda.shtml|url-status=live}}</ref> Boric thanked Kast during his victory speech, saying "we must build bridges for our compatriots to live better, because that is the people of Chile's demand".<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.radioagricultura.cl/nacional/2021/12/19/gabriel-boric-agradecio-a-jose-antonio-kast-en-su-primer-discurso-como-presidente-electo-se-que-mas-alla-de-las-diferencias-sabremos-construir-puentes.html|title=Gabriel Boric agradeció a José Antonio Kast en su primer discurso como Presidente electo: "Sé que más allá de las diferencias, sabremos construir puentes"|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=Radio Agricultura|language=es|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220052233/https://www.radioagricultura.cl/nacional/2021/12/19/gabriel-boric-agradecio-a-jose-antonio-kast-en-su-primer-discurso-como-presidente-electo-se-que-mas-alla-de-las-diferencias-sabremos-construir-puentes.html|url-status=live}}</ref>

Outgoing president [[Sebastián Piñera]] had a video call with president-elect Boric, which was broadcast live on TV and radio, complying with one of the country's electoral traditions since the [[Chilean transition to democracy|transition to democracy]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2021/12/20/el-cordial-saludo-por-tv-de-sebastian-pinera-a-gabriel-boric-una-tradicion-en-chile-que-contrasta-con-el-resto-del-continente/|title=El cordial saludo por TV de Sebastián Piñera a Gabriel Boric, una tradición en Chile que contrasta con el resto del continente|accessdate=2021-12-20|date=2021-12-19|work=infobae|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220103221/https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2021/12/20/el-cordial-saludo-por-tv-de-sebastian-pinera-a-gabriel-boric-una-tradicion-en-chile-que-contrasta-con-el-resto-del-continente/|url-status=live}}</ref> During their conversation, Piñera congratulated Boric and said "when we divide [our country] in wars between ourselves, things always go wrong. We all hope you make a very good government for Chile and the Chileans and I am sure you will do your best". Boric said "I am going to be the President of all Chileans, because I believe it is important to interpret everyone and agreements should be between all of the people and not inside four walls".<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/pinera-llama-a-boric-y-lo-felicita-por-su-triunfo-la-democracia-cumplio-y-los-chilenos-han-dado-un-nuevo-ejemplo-de-democracia-usted-fue-parte-de-eso-asi-que-lo-felicito/B52RMFLUWVC4PNQG6T2HLU3CWA/|title=Piñera llama a Boric y lo felicita por su triunfo: "Estoy seguro que usted va a entregar lo mejor de sí mismo"|accessdate=2021-12-20|last=Martínez|first=Roberto|date=2021-12-19|work=La Tercera|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220005828/https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/pinera-llama-a-boric-y-lo-felicita-por-su-triunfo-la-democracia-cumplio-y-los-chilenos-han-dado-un-nuevo-ejemplo-de-democracia-usted-fue-parte-de-eso-asi-que-lo-felicito/B52RMFLUWVC4PNQG6T2HLU3CWA/|url-status=live}}</ref>

Boric was also congratulated by President of the [[Constitutional Convention (Chile)|Constitutional Convention]], [[Elisa Loncón]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.24horas.cl/elecciones-2021/noticias-elecciones/gonzalo-winter-llamada-presidente-boric-elisa-loncon|title=Gonzalo Winter: "La primera llamada que tuvo el presidente Boric fue con Elisa Loncon"|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=24 horas|language=es-CL|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220091520/https://www.24horas.cl/elecciones-2021/noticias-elecciones/gonzalo-winter-llamada-presidente-boric-elisa-loncon|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.t13.cl/noticia/convencion-constitucional/elecciones-2021/politica/elisa-loncon-jaime-bassa-felicitan-gabriel-apoyo-institucional-robusto-20-12-2021|title=Loncon y Bassa felicitan a Boric: "Esperamos un apoyo institucional robusto"|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=T13|date=20 December 2021 |archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220050542/https://www.t13.cl/noticia/convencion-constitucional/elecciones-2021/politica/elisa-loncon-jaime-bassa-felicitan-gabriel-apoyo-institucional-robusto-20-12-2021|url-status=live}}</ref> The leader of [[Coordinadora Arauco-Malleco]], [[Héctor Llaitul]], dismissed Boric as being together with Kast "two faces of the same coin" and warned that Boric will maintain "the colonial-format capitalist system". Llaitul pledged to continue "the path of revolutionary autonomism".<ref>{{Cite news|title=La CAM sale a criticar a Boric y advierte que seguirá "en la senda de la autonomía revolucionaria"|url=https://www.t13.cl/noticia/ex-ante/nacional/la-cam-sale-criticar-boric-y-advierte-seguira-senda-autonomia-revolucionaria|date=2021-12-21|work=[[Canal 13 (Chilean TV channel)|T13]]}}</ref>

===International reaction===
Among international leaders who congratulated Boric are [[President of Argentina]] [[Alberto Fernández]],<ref name="ambito">{{cite web|url=https://www.ambito.com/politica/chile/alberto-fernandez-y-cristina-kirchner-felicitaron-boric-su-victoria-el-pueblo-siempre-vuelve-n5338295|title=Alberto Fernández y Cristina Kirchner felicitaron a Boric por su victoria en Chile: "El pueblo siempre vuelve"|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=www.ambito.com|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220053846/https://www.ambito.com/politica/chile/alberto-fernandez-y-cristina-kirchner-felicitaron-boric-su-victoria-el-pueblo-siempre-vuelve-n5338295|url-status=live}}</ref> Vice President [[Cristina Fernández de Kirchner|Cristina Kirchner]],<ref name ="ambito" /> [[President of Bolivia]] [[Luis Arce]],<ref>{{cite news|url=https://elcomercio.pe/mundo/latinoamerica/elecciones-chile-2021-el-presidente-de-bolivia-dice-que-triunfo-de-gabriel-boric-fortalece-la-democracia-luis-arce-jose-antonio-kast-quien-gano-la-segunda-vuelta-en-chile-donde-ver-el-resultado-de-las-elecciones-presidenciales-en-chile-en-directo-minuto-a-minuto-servel-balotaje-izquierda-vs-ultraderecha-la-moneda-sebastian-pinera-noticia/|title=El presidente de Bolivia dice que triunfo de Boric "fortalece" la democracia|accessdate=2021-12-19|date=2021-12-20|work=elcomercio.pe|language=|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220022233/https://elcomercio.pe/mundo/latinoamerica/elecciones-chile-2021-el-presidente-de-bolivia-dice-que-triunfo-de-gabriel-boric-fortalece-la-democracia-luis-arce-jose-antonio-kast-quien-gano-la-segunda-vuelta-en-chile-donde-ver-el-resultado-de-las-elecciones-presidenciales-en-chile-en-directo-minuto-a-minuto-servel-balotaje-izquierda-vs-ultraderecha-la-moneda-sebastian-pinera-noticia/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.efe.com/efe/america/politica/el-presidente-de-bolivia-dice-que-triunfo-boric-fortalece-la-democracia/20000035-4701975|title=El presidente de Bolivia dice que triunfo de Boric "fortalece" la democracia|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=efe.com|language=|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220053736/https://www.efe.com/efe/america/politica/el-presidente-de-bolivia-dice-que-triunfo-boric-fortalece-la-democracia/20000035-4701975|url-status=live}}</ref> President of the [[Chamber of Senators (Bolivia)|Chamber of Senators of Bolivia]] [[Andrónico Rodríguez]],<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.paginasiete.bo/planeta/2021/12/20/el-mas-los-gobiernos-de-izquierda-felicitan-la-victoria-de-boric-318541.html|title=El MAS y los gobiernos de izquierda felicitan la victoria de Boric|accessdate=2021-12-20|date=2021-12-20|work=paginasiete.bo|language=}}</ref> former [[President of Brazil]] [[Lula da Silva]],<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2021/12/20/lideres-del-mundo-saludaron-a-gabriel-boric-por-su-victoria-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/|title=Líderes del mundo saludaron a Gabriel Boric por su victoria en las elecciones de Chile|accessdate=2021-12-20|date=2021-12-19|work=infobae|language=es-ES|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220104232/https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2021/12/20/lideres-del-mundo-saludaron-a-gabriel-boric-por-su-victoria-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/|url-status=live}}</ref> [[President of Colombia]] [[Iván Duque]],<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.semana.com/nacion/articulo/presidente-ivan-duque-felicita-a-gabriel-boric-tras-ganar-las-elecciones-en-chile/202136/ |title=Presidente Iván Duque felicita a Gabriel Boric tras ganar las elecciones en Chile |publisher=Semana.com |date= 20 December 2021|accessdate=2021-12-20 |archive-date=20 December 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220080313/https://www.semana.com/nacion/articulo/presidente-ivan-duque-felicita-a-gabriel-boric-tras-ganar-las-elecciones-en-chile/202136/ |url-status=live }}</ref> [[President of Costa Rica]] [[Carlos Alvarado]],<ref>{{Cite tweet|last=Alvarado Quesada|first=Carlos|number=1472706621264572417|user=CarlosAlvQ|title=Mis sinceras felicitaciones a @gabrielboric, Presidente electo de Chile, y al hermano pueblo chileno por este ejercicio democrático. Le deseo que logre conducir a 🇨🇱 por el mejor camino, para el bienestar del pueblo chileno. @CRcancilleria|date=19 December 2021|access-date=20 December 2021|language=es|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220044605/https://twitter.com/carlosalvq/status/1472706621264572417|archive-date=20 December 2021|url-status=live|trans-title=My sincere congratulations to @gabrielboric, President-elect of Chile, and to the Chilean people for this democratic exercise. I wish him success in leading Chile along the best path, for the welfare of the Chilean people. [[Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Worship (Costa Rica)|@CRcancilleria]]}}</ref> [[President of Ecuador]] [[Guillermo Lasso]],<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.pichinchacomunicaciones.com.ec/guillermo-lasso-felicita-y-desea-exitos-a-gabriel-boric-presidente-electo-de-chile/ |title=Guillermo Lasso felicita y desea éxitos a Gabriel Boric, presidente electo de Chile – Radio Pichincha |publisher=Pichinchacomunicaciones.com.ec |date= 19 December 2021|accessdate=2021-12-20 |archive-date=20 December 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220030038/https://www.pichinchacomunicaciones.com.ec/guillermo-lasso-felicita-y-desea-exitos-a-gabriel-boric-presidente-electo-de-chile/ |url-status=live }}</ref> [[Prime Minister of Spain]] [[Pedro Sánchez]],<ref>{{cite web|author=Agencia EFE |url=https://es.noticias.yahoo.com/s%C3%A1nchez-felicita-boric-esperanza-futuro-002204697.html?guccounter=1&guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS8&guce_referrer_sig=AQAAAB1wzzGEs3xcZedHoEOF_JkPP7oZ9Mqk30HlE8HenCNA4K5ytZg413wFAEfCirKKwh6-c0OuOSyD0iMnTY3miS6rZxisI4FP8uzvn_KWcDJeTNGjTX36hiYpeS92816i4EqegVVc3NxuV9Fg7jU_kmF_vOUmUxqUa27hwqkVRwCS |title=España felicita a Boric y le desea muchos éxitos como presidente de Chile |publisher=Es.noticias.yahoo.com |date= |accessdate=2021-12-20}}</ref> [[US Secretary of State]] [[Antony Blinken]],<ref>{{cite web|url=https://cooperativa.cl/noticias/pais/politica/presidenciales/estados-unidos-felicito-a-boric-y-espera-seguir-trabajando-con-chile-por/2021-12-20/130008.html|title=Estados Unidos felicitó a Boric y espera seguir trabajando con Chile por la seguridad|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=Cooperativa.cl|language=Spanish}}</ref> [[Ministry for Europe and Foreign Affairs (France)|Minister for Europe and Foreign Affairs]] of France [[Jean-Yves Le Drian]], [[Mayor of Paris]] [[Anne Hidalgo]], [[President of Mexico]] [[Andrés Manuel López Obrador]] and his Foreign Secretary [[Marcelo Ebrard]],<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.france24.com/es/minuto-a-minuto/20211220-l%C3%ADderes-saludan-el-triunfo-del-izquierdista-gabriel-boric-en-chile |title=Líderes saludan el triunfo del izquierdista Gabriel Boric en Chile |publisher=France24.com |date= 20 December 2021|accessdate=2021-12-20 |archive-date=20 December 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220071433/https://www.france24.com/es/minuto-a-minuto/20211220-l%C3%ADderes-saludan-el-triunfo-del-izquierdista-gabriel-boric-en-chile |url-status=live }}</ref> [[President of Peru]] [[Pedro Castillo]],<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://rpp.pe/peru/actualidad/pedro-castillo-felicito-a-gabriel-boric-la-victoria-que-has-alcanzado-la-compartimos-los-pueblos-latinoamericanos-noticia-1375941 |title=Pedro Castillo felicitó a Gabriel Boric: "La victoria que has alcanzado la compartimos los pueblos latinoamericanos" |website=[[Radio Programas del Perú|RPP Noticias]] |date=19 December 2021 |access-date=20 December 2021 |archive-date=20 December 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220032316/https://rpp.pe/peru/actualidad/pedro-castillo-felicito-a-gabriel-boric-la-victoria-que-has-alcanzado-la-compartimos-los-pueblos-latinoamericanos-noticia-1375941 |url-status=live |language=es}}</ref> [[President of Uruguay]] [[Luis Lacalle Pou]],<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.efe.com/efe/america/politica/lacalle-pou-felicita-a-boric-y-le-desea-un-gobierno-para-el-bien-de-chile/20000035-4701942|title=Lacalle Pou felicita a Boric y le desea un Gobierno "para el bien" de Chile|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=www.efe.com|language=es|archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220023442/https://www.efe.com/efe/america/politica/lacalle-pou-felicita-a-boric-y-le-desea-un-gobierno-para-el-bien-de-chile/20000035-4701942|url-status=live}}</ref> [[President of Venezuela]] [[Nicolás Maduro]],<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.t13.cl/noticia/elecciones-2021/politica/nicolas-maduro-gabriel-boric-triunfo-segunda-vuelta-contundente-victoria-fascismo-19-12-2021|title=Maduro saluda a Boric por triunfo en segunda vuelta: "Contundente victoria sobre el fascismo"|accessdate=2021-12-20|work=T13|date=19 December 2021 |archive-date=20 December 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220050551/https://www.t13.cl/noticia/elecciones-2021/politica/nicolas-maduro-gabriel-boric-triunfo-segunda-vuelta-contundente-victoria-fascismo-19-12-2021|url-status=live}}</ref> and opposition leaders of Venezuela [[Juan Guaidó]] and [[Henrique Capriles]].<ref>{{Cite tweet|last=Guaidó|first=Juan|number=1472743546801246210|user=jguaido|title=Los venezolanos luchamos por poder elegir libremente como lo ha hecho hoy Chile. Queremos felicitar el Pdte electo @gabrielboric en quien confiamos mantenga el apoyo en la defensa de los DDHH en nuestro país y realice una buena gestión por el bienestar de los venezolanos en Chile|date=19 December 2021|access-date=20 December 2021|language=es|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220014030/https://twitter.com/jguaido/status/1472743546801246210|archive-date=20 December 2021|url-status=live|trans-title=Venezuelans are fighting to be able to choose freely as Chile has done today. We would like to congratulate the President elect @gabrielboric who we trust will continue to support the defense of human rights in our country and will do a good job for the welfare of Venezuelans in Chile.}}</ref> The [[European Union]], via its [[High Representative of the Union for Foreign Affairs and Security Policy]] [[Josep Borrell]], also congratulated Boric on his victory in the second round and pointed to "strengthening" relations with the Chilean government.<ref>[https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2021/12/20/lideres-del-mundo-saludaron-a-gabriel-boric-por-su-victoria-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/ Líderes del mundo saludaron a Gabriel Boric por su victoria en las elecciones de Chile] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211220104232/https://www.infobae.com/america/america-latina/2021/12/20/lideres-del-mundo-saludaron-a-gabriel-boric-por-su-victoria-en-las-elecciones-de-chile/ |date=20 December 2021 }} {{in lang|es}}</ref>

President of Brazil [[Jair Bolsonaro]] had a late and cold reaction to Boric's election. He pointed out that "half of the population abstained" in the election, and referred to Boric as "that Boric".<ref name=Tercera24Bolsonaro>{{Cite news|title=Bolsonaro y su tardío saludo a Boric: los cruces más polémicos de una relación tensa|url=https://www.latercera.com/la-tercera-pm/noticia/bolsonaro-y-su-tardio-saludo-a-boric-los-cruces-mas-polemicos-de-una-relacion-tensa/7HCBYA3V3VCUFFBHB5TL4DC3GE/|last=Fuentes|first=Fernando|date=2021-12-24|access-date=2021-12-25|work=[[La Tercera]]|language=Spanish}}</ref>{{Efn|Prior to his election, Boric had criticized Bolsonaro's positions on the [[military dictatorship in Brazil]] (1964–1985) and called him "a danger for the environment and for humanity". Bolsonaro has made it a custom to react late to the election of left-wing presidents in the region, as he did with [[Alberto Fernández]] in Argentina.<ref name=Tercera24Bolsonaro/>}} Boric responded to Bolsonaro's comments by stating that "clearly we are very different".<ref name=TerceraDistintos>{{Cite news|title=Boric responde a dichos de Jair Bolsonaro: "Claramente somos muy distintos"|url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/boric-responde-a-dichos-de-jair-bolsonaro-claramente-somos-muy-distintos/XSELRULLMRAZVBT4B7T5HQG6RY/ |last=Castillo|first=Viviana|date=2021-12-24|access-date=2021-12-25|work=[[La Tercera]]|language=Spanish}}</ref> Bolsonaro's son [[Eduardo Bolsonaro|Eduardo]], who had supported Kast, had a harsher reaction, stating that Chile was set on a path similar to [[Crisis in Venezuela|Maduro's Venezuela]] with Boric. He mentioned the –8% drop that occurred in the [[Santiago Stock Exchange]] following the election and linked Boric to the [[Estallido Social|violence that erupted in Chile in 2019]].<ref name=Tercera24Bolsonaro/>

President of the United States [[Joe Biden]] had a phone conversation with president-elect Boric on 30 December,<ref>{{Cite news|title=Joe Biden felicita al Presidente electo Boric por su triunfo: "Conversamos sobre desafíos comunes"|url=https://www.t13.cl/noticia/politica/joe-biden-presidente-eeuu-felicita-gabriel-boric-triunfo-elecciones-30-12-2021|date=2021-12-30|access-date=2021-12-31|work=T13|language=es-CL|trans-title=Joe Biden congratulates President-elect Boric on his victory: "We talked about common challenges"|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211231234901/https://www.t13.cl/noticia/politica/joe-biden-presidente-eeuu-felicita-gabriel-boric-triunfo-elecciones-30-12-2021|archive-date=31 December 2021|url-status=live}}</ref> on which Biden congratulated Boric for his victory. In a press statement published by the [[White House]],<ref>{{Cite news|title=Statement by Press Secretary Jen Psaki on President Biden's Call with President-elect Gabriel Boric of Chile|url=https://bidenwhitehouse.archives.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2021/12/30/statement-by-press-secretary-jen-psaki-on-president-bidens-call-with-president-elect-gabriel-boric-of-chile/|date=2021-12-30|access-date=2021-12-31|work=[[White House|WhiteHouse.gov]]|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211231234903/https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2021/12/30/statement-by-press-secretary-jen-psaki-on-president-bidens-call-with-president-elect-gabriel-boric-of-chile/|archive-date=31 December 2021|url-status=live}}</ref> Biden "applauded Chile's free and fair elections as a powerful example to the region and the world", and also underscored the cooperation between Chile and the U.S. to "promote a green and equitable recovery from the COVID-19 pandemic and to address the existential threat posed by climate change". Biden also sent through the president-elect his condolences for the death of 14-year old [[List of killings by law enforcement officers in the United States, December 2021|Valentina Orellana-Peralta]], who was killed in a police shootout at Los Angeles, California on 23 December. Boric later posted on his Twitter account about the conversation he had with President Biden, stating that "In addition to the shared joy for our respective electoral victories, we talked about common challenges such as fair trade, climate crisis and strengthening democracy. We will continue to talk."<ref>{{Cite tweet|number=1476698436472770567|last=Boric Font|first=Gabriel|user=gabrielboric|title=Acabo de recibir llamada del Presidente de USA @joebiden. Además de la alegría compartida por nuestros respectivos triunfos electorales conversamos sobre desafíos comunes como comercio justo, crisis climática y fortalecimiento de la democracia. Seguiremos conversando.|date=30 December 2021|language=es-CL|url-status=live|trans-title=I just received a call from US President [[Joe Biden|@joebiden]]. In addition to the shared joy for our respective electoral victories, we talked about common challenges such as fair trade, climate crisis and strengthening democracy. We will continue to talk.|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211231212314/https://twitter.com/gabrielboric/status/1476698436472770567|archive-date=31 December 2021}}</ref>

=== Parliamentary results ===
Due to the low results in the parliamentary election, 12 political parties were dissolved by the Electoral Service: [[Christian Conservative Party (Chile)|Christian Conservative Party]] (1 deputy), [[Citizens (Chilean political party)|Citizens]] (1), [[Democratic Independent Regionalist Party]] (1), [[Equality Party (Chile)|Equality Party]], [[Green Ecologist Party (Chile)|Green Ecological Party]] (2), [[Humanist Party (Chile)|Humanist Party]] (3), [[Progressive Party (Chile)|Progressive Party]], [[National Citizen Party (Chile)|National Citizen Party]], [[New Time (Chile)|New Time]], [[Patriotic Union (Chile)|Patriotic Union]], [[Revolutionary Workers Party (Chile)|Revolutionary Workers Party]] and [[United Centre (Chile)|United Centre]] (1).<ref>{{Cite web|last=Pérez|first=Graciela|date=2022-02-07|title=Servel dispone la disolución de 12 partidos políticos por no cumplir la normativa legal|url=https://www.latercera.com/politica/noticia/servel-dispone-la-disolucion-de-12-partidos-politicos-por-no-cumplir-la-normativa-legal/2R7E5XCGVVC2JCXWAZYJ5DX4QA/|access-date=2022-02-08|website=La Tercera}}</ref> 9 deputies became independent politicians before joining the new Congress.

